PayCard Inc. (/ˈviːzə, ˈviːsə/) is an [[United Midlands|Midlands]] multinational payment card services corporation headquartered in [[Brukelyn]]. It facilitates electronic funds transfers throughout the world, most commonly through PayCard-branded credit cards, debit cards and prepaid cards.

PayCard does not issue cards, extend credit, or set rates and fees for consumers; rather, Visa provides financial institutions with Visa-branded payment products that they then use to offer credit, debit, prepaid and cash access programs to their customers. In 2025, PayCard's global network (known as PayNet) processed 257.5 billion transactions worth I$14.2 trillion.